Fixed IOS-XR interface name canonicalization to expand the `BE`, `BV`, and `PE` abbreviations. IOS-XR parsers such as `show interface brief`, `show interfaces description`, `show ospf vrf all interface brief`, and `show l2vpn xconnect` now emit `Bundle-Ether`, `BVI`, and `PW-Ether` interface names instead of `BE`, `BV`, and `PE`.
